Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: verify deferred fault notification in the PA-off audit

Let a SoundWire status notifier enqueue only a pre-armed work item.
Keep the diagnostic lifetime scoped to the current muted prepare. Test
the same notification via a synthetic event, verify both PA-off stops
and join the work before issuing the existing token-matched DSP STOP.

